            "review_title": "Review at Blue Sky Restaurant/ Elios Hotel",
            "review_text": "O_Coucoo_c_est_moi\nCergy, France214 contributions\n1\nSky Bar offering a beautiful view!\nMar 2024 • Couples\nFrom the top we discover a very beautiful view of Ho Chi Min City. We were there for a simple aperitif at sunset. No need to stay in the hotel. Enter the lobby and head to the elevators and go up to the top floor. I had a very good Martini lechee cocktail for €3.50.\nA bit of a kitsch atmosphere, but the view is worth a look!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 10, 2024",
