            "review_title": "Review at Blue Sky Restaurant/ Elios Hotel",
            "review_text": "K7R19\nLiverpool, United Kingdom74 contributions\n0\nA MUST DO, simply for the view of the city!\nFeb 2016 • Couples\nSo after researching the best sky bars on Google, and the rules regarding strict dress policies, entrance fees and minimum spend allowances, we were so pleased to find Blue Sky bar restaurant at Elios Hotel. The bar is situated on he 12th floor, beautiful views of the city lit up at night. There appeared to be no dress code or flip flop/thong policy. There was no entrance fee - we were purchasing drinks at a reasonable price considering the location. The staff were also very friendly and attentive. Cannot comment on the food as we did not eat here, but a great place for drinks on your last night in HCMC.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 18, 2016",
